meta {
  name: Org
  seq: 6
}

docs {
  Household organization APIs (E1–E4). Bearer {{token}} required.

  Org CRUD:
  - POST   /v1/orgs
  - GET    /v1/orgs
  - GET    /v1/orgs/:id
  - PATCH  /v1/orgs/:id
  - DELETE /v1/orgs/:id

  Members:
  - GET    /v1/orgs/:id/members
  - GET    /v1/orgs/:id/members/:userId
  - PATCH  /v1/orgs/:id/members/:userId
  - DELETE /v1/orgs/:id/members/:userId

  Invites:
  - POST   /v1/orgs/:id/invites
  - GET    /v1/orgs/:id/invites
  - DELETE /v1/orgs/:id/invites/:inviteId

  Shared resources (E3):
  - GET /v1/orgs/:id/webhooks
  - GET /v1/orgs/:id/trades
  - GET /v1/orgs/:id/pnl

  Governance (E4):
  - GET  /v1/orgs/:id/usage
  - GET  /v1/orgs/:id/activity
  - POST /v1/orgs/:id/transfer-ownership
  - POST /v1/orgs/:id/leave

  Prerequisites: admin sets plan=household + orgs_enabled=true on owner.
}
